---
description: Loading indicator pattern (DialogUtils)
alwaysApply: true
---
 Loading indicator pattern (DialogUtils):

  When implementing async operations with a loading dialog:

  - Open loading without await and track with a boolean:
      bool loadingOpen = false;
      if (mounted) {
        DialogUtils.openLoading(context, message: 'İşlem yapılıyor...');
        loadingOpen = true;
      }

  - Always close the loading BEFORE showing info/error dialogs:
      if (mounted && loadingOpen) {
        Navigator.of(context, rootNavigator: true).pop();
        loadingOpen = false;
      }

  - Wrap async work in try / catch / finally:
    - In try: perform the operation.
    - On success:
        - close loading (if open)
        - show info dialog (DialogUtils.openInfo)
        - refresh data/state if needed.
    - On error:
        - close loading (if open)
        - show error dialog (DialogUtils.openError)
    - In finally:
        - reset local busy flags with setState if mounted.

  - Always use mounted checks before:
    - opening/closing dialogs
    - calling setState
    - using context-dependent APIs.